        "TileImage": "$($repository 00df867e-f27f-4904-8bc7-9504443ccb5a).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47. Today, Our client is an old employee of our target Rico Delgado. Rico is a millionaire who got rich years ago through illegal drug dealing and now lives in his own mansion in the middle of the Santa Fortuna jungle. Rico fired our client for no good reason. Our client knows that in the &quot;Garage&quot; in the yard of the mansion there is a secret button that opens a secret door to the basement, where you should find &quot;Shashka A33 Gold&quot;, which will give us big money on the black market.",
